{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af52a77c2ddb05a7fe2e229","chatId":"c13235778cca4aab8afcfaeee4e4e0ef","sessionId":null,"userId":77273,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1195,"promptTokens":1579,"completionTokens":36,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01798620996209156,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a77c2ddb05a7fe2e228","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452087905,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af52a77c2ddb05a7fe2e228","chatId":"c13235778cca4aab8afcfaeee4e4e0ef","sessionId":null,"userId":77273,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n李华，一个村里的小贩，经常在市场上卖水果。一天，他发现自己的一箱苹果不翼而飞。同一天，张伟，一个经常光顾李华摊位的顾客，无意中在市场后面发现了这箱苹果。他认为是有人遗弃了这些苹果，便把它们带回家。另一方面，王莉，张伟的邻居，知道这些苹果是李华的，但因为她和张伟关系不好，故意不告诉他真相。几天后，李华在与朋友聊天时得知了苹果的下落。\n\n[问题]\n王莉知道这些苹果是李华的却没有告诉张伟，她会感到什么样的情绪？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 王莉可能会感到满足，因为她利用了这个机会来对付她不喜欢的邻居。\nB. 王莉可能感到内疚，因为她知道自己做错了事。\nC. 王莉可能感到无动于衷，因为她认为这不关她的事。\nD. 王莉可能感到担心，害怕事情败露。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01798620996209156,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a77c2ddb05a7fe2e229","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452087902,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7222702e5ecd46d798131a47835472c2"}